    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people can help. i've heard that a thousand times. but it's not about 'loneliness' in the way you think. it's like... i've spent so much energy trying to stay afloat, trying to be okay, and now i'm just exhausted. everything i do feels like it's just maintaining a prison. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just stop being here. like, if there's no 'me' left, then the cage doesn't matter anymore.",
